  "notes": "candidate=1, measured 2026-11-18 (lane22 r2 on S002 seed 130365: A/B/C inside playable, infantry reachable from both bases and stagings, three vehicle routes flood-measured 720/798/701 m; Design/AgentReports/SkirmishExpansion/S007/area-measurement-r2.json; geometry still a candidate). Earlier history: bases, side pads, routes and per-building pads moved to the S006 example's Unity-measured legal positions, so the first measurement (Design/AgentReports/SkirmishExpansion/S007/area-measurement.json, old enemy base [1387.8,650]) no longer describes this draft and the S007 draft removed that pointer until the r2 measurement was attached. Lane20 menu launch aborted BlockedSpawn because S007 was copied (a70de70f9, 2026-11-17 09:37) from the S006 example before its spawn fixes (5e1eb1b9c..29dc2818b): enemy HQ/staging on map buildings and road, and no instance_pads, so every building pad was derived from those positions. Desert Base host geometry only (air.* was dropped in S007 Ground Maneuver Field). Side anchors/pads, basemove routes and instance pads: Tools/Missions/examples/s006-desert-base-ba-combined-established.json (legal candidates from lane4-dump-S002); instance pads ordered like SkirmishSetupCompiler.BuildStructures so each building takes the pad measured for its own footprint. S007 Frontline Control areas unchanged: A = north-flank strip (ruins.west..ruins.east x, ruins.own..ruins.north z); B = centre block (highway.near..far x, z 621.2..678.8); C = south-flank strip (sweep.west..east x, sweep.south..sweep.own z). structure_footprints copied from the S006 example (map-independent native footprints). S009 Air / Field sibling. Shared geometry and area_measurement copied from S007; the r2 artifact covers the shared FC geometry on the S002 host. Air-return centres copied from S006 air.player and air.enemy; the explicit enemy pad is copied from S006 pads and the player kind pad comes from its anchor as in S006. Field starts have the seven S007 starting structures per faction in every size; the retained S006 air-return points are candidates and have no starting helipad instance. Unmeasured: S006 has no measured Airport position; BuildStructures grants no starting Airport, and the footprint entry is retained.",
